# EmailJS Setup Instructions:
# 1. Sign up for free at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (connect with Gmail: shijanpias3@gmail.com) -> Copy your Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template -> Copy your Template ID
# 4. In EmailJS Account Settings -> API Keys -> Copy your Public Key
# 5. Paste the values below:

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
